# EigenScript gap: no 64-bit integer; arithmetic past 2^53 silently rounds
# (EigenScript#1286 row "One overloaded number type": an integer type, or
# raise on precision loss; silence is the option to rule out).
# Lua:      2^53 + 1 (integers) -> 9007199254740993
#           math.maxinteger + 1 == math.mininteger -> true (wraps)
# Expected: 9007199254740993, or an error on precision loss.
# Actual v0.44.0:  9007199254740992, and 9223372036854775807 + 1 prints a
#           rounded 9.223372036854776e+18 with no error.
# Rows: int_past53, int_maxinteger, int_wrap (D).
print of (9007199254740992 + 1)
print of (9223372036854775807 + 1)
print of (9223372036854775807 == 9223372036854775806)
